# Adapted from ntc-templates (Apache-2.0); see NOTICE.md.
Value Filldown vrf (\S+)
Value Required interface (\S+)
Value Required ip_address ([a-zA-Z0-9./]+|forward-enabled)
Value interface_status (\S+-\S+)
Value link_status (\S+-\S+)
Value protocol_status (\S+-\S+)
Value address_family (\S+)

Start
  ^IP\s+Interface\s+Status\s+for\s+VRF\s+"${vrf}"\(\d+\)
  ^Interface\s+IP\s+Address\s+Interface\s+Status
  ^\S+\s+unnumbered\s+\S+
  ^\s+\(\w+\)
  ^${interface}\s+${ip_address}\s+${protocol_status}/${link_status}/${interface_status} -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$ -> Error
